        <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:lang="lzh" xml:space="preserve">
<ab>
<lb n="1"/><persName>釋迦</persName>雙林後一千六百廿三年，
<lb n="2"/><persName>大沙門僧安道壹</persName>書刊<persName>大空王佛</persName>七
<lb n="3"/><unclear>□</unclear><unclear>佛</unclear><unclear>□□□□□</unclear><unclear>□</unclear><unclear>手</unclear>書經<unclear>□□</unclear><unclear>□</unclear><unclear>頌</unclear><unclear>願</unclear><unclear>□</unclear>此
<lb n="4"/>功徳具神<unclear>通</unclear><unclear>思</unclear><unclear>□</unclear>力，<unclear>行</unclear><unclear>□</unclear><unclear>□□□□</unclear><unclear>薩</unclear><unclear>□</unclear>婆若
<lb n="5"/><unclear>□□□</unclear>界<unclear>□□□□</unclear><unclear>手成戌百</unclear><unclear>□□</unclear><unclear>佊</unclear><unclear>彼</unclear><unclear>□</unclear><unclear>□□□</unclear>助成。
</ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus"/>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
                <p>One thousand six hundred twenty three years after Śākyamuni [entered into nirvana] under the twin trees [556], the Great Renunciant (śramaṇa) Seng’an Daoyi wrote and carved: Buddha King of Great Emptiness, seven [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] [...] wrote sutras [...] [...] [...] [...] this merit and virtue is endowed with supernatural powers, practicing [...] [...] [...] [...] perfect knowledge [...] [...] [...] sphere [...] [...] [...] [...] that [...] [...] [...] support the completion.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
